WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.200
Review the traffic plan with your supervisor before starting.
Locate entrances, exits, travel directions, and pedestrian and
emergency routes.

00:00:10.800 --> 00:00:20.760
Check sightlines, blind spots and vehicle turning paths. If
visibility drops, notify control and apply the restrictions in
the plan.

